message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "Two-per-line functional batch codes over even finite fields"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For q=2^a at least 4 and every s, proves FB(s,N+1,q)=2N, where N is the number of one-dimensional subspaces. This fills the even-field gap in Kılıç–Ravagnani–Salizzoni Open Problem 3.13."
